<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[18px]">bolt</span>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase text-on-surface-variant font-semibold">CEB ToD Window:</span>
</div>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm px-space-xs py-space-2xs rounded bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-container font-semibold" id="tariffWindowIndicator">
